        <detaileddescription>
<para>Returns a new <ref refid="structcuda_1_1experimental_1_1kernel__config" kindref="compound">kernel_config</ref> that has all option and dimensions from this <ref refid="structcuda_1_1experimental_1_1kernel__config" kindref="compound">kernel_config</ref> with the option from the argument added to it</para>
